{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/Gif_01.gif?t=1746002886\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soldier, what are you doing here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Arm yourself with unique weapons and use combinations of abilities on different levels to survive and destroy hordes of your enemies led by their master, a hideous but very powerful necromancer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fight on the levels-arenas, which you will have to pass using unique weapons, from axe to the most powerful blaster - vaporizing everything in its path, as well as various perks that can strengthen you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1746002886\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Huge hordes</strong> of enemies will chase you, but only you can fight back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Stay alive</strong>. Don't let any of them lay a finger on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The <strong>Powerful weapons</strong> you find will help you in destroying any obstacle encountered on the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Use various abilities</strong> that will help you become faster, stronger and more agile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Dynamic music</strong> that will match your intense battles perfectly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All this will take place in different locations, from city streets and green parks to unexplored bunkers, where unimaginable monsters hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1746002886\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2879200?t=1746002886"